`1182060` | approve |\n| Connector | `1182060` | 4 P1, lớp `luat-moi-chua-noi-vao-may-trang-thai-va-hieu-luc` |\n| Codex CLI 4 / 5 | `2f3f388` / `098a693` | F04 P2 → approve |\n| Connector | `098a693` | 1 P1 + 2 P2, cùng lớp (lần thứ ba) |\n| Codex CLI 6 | `1b375db` | **approve**, 0 P0–P2 |\n| Connector | `1b375db` | đang chờ |\n\nLời gọi Codex CLI: 6/8.\n\n## Nợ (P3)\n\n- `MAY-ADR-0054` (packet máy, điều kiện kích hoạt)\n- `WP784-R2-A7-DO-PHU`\n- `WP784-R2-TIEU-CHI-THIEU-VE-DUONG`\n- `CONG-DEM-PUSH`\n- `R291-DAM-SO-CUNG` (lần 5)\n- `SO-CANON-CHUA-TON-TAI`\n\n**Thứ tự land:** #785 (đặc tả) trước, rồi PR này. Chủ kho merge.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01XaeBSkW4R49AEWj6x4uqff)_","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T08:33:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T11:53:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-17T11:53:00Z","merged_at":"2026-10-17T11:53:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"7cc384ec9e02ed79b429ac6ee2455d3bfbb75b16","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ducthangho:agent/wp784-g2-claude","ref":"agent/wp784-g2-claude","repo":{"id":1289195917,"node_id":"R_kgDOTNeRjQ","name":"tra-luat","full_name":"ducthangho/tra-luat","owner":{"login":"ducthangho","id":12748935,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzQ4OTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12748935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho","html_url":"https://github.com/ducthangho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/repos","e